{"ID":"20240515131402-nq5p7go","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131402-nq5p7go","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131402-nq5p7go\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141553-z9et4a0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141553-z9et4a0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141553-z9et4a0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:318,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:318\u0026#125;","title":"076","type":"doc","updated":"20240515141553"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515141553-z9et4a0","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 895px;","id":"20240515141553-z9et4a0","updated":"20240515141553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2005/05/05"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LR"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"約五十歲。偏瘦。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/21"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此女因慢性盲腸炎，師用大黃牡丹皮湯加減，腹痛大減。八月七日來診時因有嘔證且脇下滿，師予大柴胡湯加芒硝，八月十四日來診時自述右下腹仍有一點痛感，嘔證去，小便深黃，師予大黃牡丹皮湯與薏苡附子敗醬草合方加減。今日來診自述服藥後反而便秘腸鳴。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）大便：服藥之後，反而便秘。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈洪大有力。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃厚"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"裏熱重"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一、大黃牡丹皮湯  200粒膠囊，早晚飯前各十粒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二、HT45(己椒藶黃丸)一罐三兩、午餐前睡前各三十粒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"芒硝一罐三兩、每次服用HT45時，沖服二茶匙。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.病家自覺腸間咕嚕有水聲，理應下利，反便秘腹滿，可知水不在腸中，而在腸外。是己椒藶黃丸證。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}